10. Session continuity (Telegram-reply-driven multi-turn).
    src/repo-chat/repo-chat-store.ts (functions saveRepoChatSession,
    findRepoChatSessionByMessageId) and the message-ref tracking in
    src/repo-chat/types.ts:5-27 wire each conversation's CLI session id
