11. Automated tests (handler + routing + worker behaviors).
    src/telegram/repo-chat-commands.test.ts — handler tests.
    src/telegram/bot-handlers.repo-chat-routing.test.ts — text routing
       to repo chat.
    src/repo-chat/repo-chat-worker.test.ts — worker behaviors
